== diags.diag/input-paren-negation
BYN1017 3:8 parentheses around a condition are an input form
  label not needed
  help remove the parentheses
  fix 3:8-3:12 !x
BYN1007 6:5 `unless` with a negated condition is a double negative
  label `unless` already negates
  help use `if` with the condition as written
  fix 6:5-6:27 if x { print("b") }
BYN1018 6:17 the body of `unless` must be a block
  label a single statement
  help wrap the statement in `{ }`
BYN1022 7:5 `unless` with `&&`/`||` reads as a double negative
  label a compound condition
  help use `if` with the negated condition
  fix 7:5-7:31 if !(x && x) { print("c") }
BYN1018 7:21 the body of `unless` must be a block
  label a single statement
  help wrap the statement in `{ }`
BYN1017 8:8 parentheses around a condition are an input form
  label not needed
  help remove the parentheses
  fix 8:8-8:12 !x
